???: You've been resting for quite some time now.
???: But im afraid your rest must come to an end.
???: ...
???: Its... The town. Something most terrible has befallen it.
???: The curse has taken hold, I'm afraid.
???: The good people... they are no longer themselves.
???: They have become something else entirely...
???: Something... wicked...
???: ...
???: As you know, you are the last of your bloodline.
???: The last who possesses the sight to see the beasts for what they truly are.
???: Others look upon them and see neighbours, friends, family.
???: But you... you see the truth beneath their deception.
???: ...
???: Others look upon them and see neighbours, friends, family. 
???: But you have seen this happen, time and time again.
???: Each moment you tarry, more innocent souls suffer.
???: The corruption spreads like a plague through the very streets.
???: ...
???: You know the way already. You have always known.
???: Trust your instincts, trust what you see with your hunter's eyes.
???: ...
???: But mark me well - they will try to confuse you.
???: They may cry out, beg for mercy, even call familiar names.
